ie season \u2014 regardless of opponent."}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-15T20:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:uvq4eydke6s6dmjtccqykgpn/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwwoxqpsc2e", "author_did": "did:plc:uvq4eydke6s6dmjtccqykgpn", "handle": "chgo-bulls.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-15T20:48:01.329Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-15T20:48:00.461Z", "text": "LIVE show at 4pm CT, Bulls Nation! Peck, Big Dave and Goat in studio talking:\n\n\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f Leonard Miller on future w/ Bulls\n\ud83e\udd14 should Bulls extend Miller NOW?\n\ud83d\udcb0 how much?\n\ud83d\udcc4 GM Survey: Caleb & Matas get votes\nwww.youtube.com/live/3V8vP18..."}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-15T21:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:c62f2mexajjqjwcjjlg2vmse/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwzkgmypc2t", "author_did": "did:plc:c62f2mexajjqjwcjjlg2vmse", "handle": "jaycohenap.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-15T21:39:10.392Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-15T21:39:12.556Z", "text": "Leonard Miller has turned into a key rotational piece for the Chicago #Bulls"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:qq6tpffju3hto3n3p4hrfekm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwywegdmc2e", "author_did": "did:plc:qq6tpffju3hto3n3p4hrfekm", "handle": "queensicez.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-15T21:27:56.990Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-15T21:27:58.663Z", "text": "br.app.link/L5FStXUAg7b"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:qq6tpffju3hto3n3p4hrfekm/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxwyw3rhb22e", "author_did": "did:plc:qq6tpffju3hto3n3p4hrfekm", "handle": "queensicez.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-15T21:27:47.916Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-15T21:27:50.163Z", "text": "br.app.link/omN9L9SAg7b.  #NBA.  #NYK. #Knicks."}]}, {"team": "chi", "query": "\"Chicago Bulls\"", "hour": "2026-10-15T22:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:ttls3yjluo7etx54agsqkkyv/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxx5wnnord2j", "author_did": "did:plc:ttls3yjluo7etx54agsqkkyv", 